# AGENT_SPEC — Personal Finance Tool
Single source of truth. Agents: follow this exactly; do not add features not listed.

## 1. Product
Local, single-user app. User uploads bank statements (.xlsx), app stores transactions in PostgreSQL once (no duplicates), classifies them automatically (by counterparty + rules) and manually. Khan Bank (Mongolia) first; more banks later via one parser file each. No auth, no server, no cloud.

## 2. Stack (fixed — do not substitute)
Python 3.11+ · PostgreSQL 15+ · Streamlit · pandas · openpyxl · SQLAlchemy 2.0 (typed `Mapped[]` style) · psycopg 3 (`psycopg[binary]`) · Alembic · python-dotenv · plotly · pyyaml · pytest.
DB URL from `.env`: `DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://USER:PASS@localhost:5432/finance`

