## 11. UI (Streamlit pages)
- Import: choose bank (PARSERS), upload .xlsx, preview first 20 rows + StatementInfo + validation result, Confirm button → import; show counts; table of past imports.
- Review: counterparties having unclassified txns, sorted by total abs amount desc. `st.data_editor` columns: match_key (ro), sample descriptions (ro, 3 distinct), txns (ro), in MNT (ro), out MNT (ro), display_name, category (selectbox "kind: name"), own account (checkbox), ask per txn (checkbox). Save → update counterparties, re-run classifier on their txns. Sidebar shows unclassified count.
- Transactions: filters (date range, account, category, unclassified only, text search) → `st.data_editor` with editable category + note; save sets category_source='manual'. Option "also create rule from this row" (match_key equals).
- Reports: date range; transfers excluded unless toggle; monthly income vs expense bars, expense by category bar + table, top 10 counterparties, savings rate; download filtered data as CSV and XLSX.
- Settings: accounts (nickname, is_own), categories (add/rename/in_reports), rules (CRUD + "Test rule" preview via test_rule), Backup button running `pg_dump` to a chosen folder (show command error clearly if pg_dump not on PATH).
Amounts display as `1,234,567.89 ₮`.

## 12. Code rules for agents
- Output complete files only, each in a code block whose first line is a comment with its path. No explanations unless asked.
- Touch only files named in the task. Don't rename spec'd names.
- Type hints, short docstrings, no print debugging, no global sessions.
- Use `with get_session() as s:` (commits on success, rolls back on exception).
- Tests use a separate DB from env `TEST_DATABASE_URL`; conftest creates/drops tables with `Base.metadata`.
- If something in the spec is impossible or ambiguous, write `# QUESTION:` at the top of the affected file and make the simplest choice.
